+---
+description: "推进到下一个工作流阶段。 / Advance to the next workflow phase."
+---
+
+Read first / 先读:
+- `.vibehub/agent-view/current.md`
+- `.vibehub/agent-view/current-context.md`
+- `.vibehub/agent-view/handoff.md`
+- `.vibehub/rules/hard-rules.md`
+- `.vibehub/adapters/protocol.md`
+
+CLI:
+  vibehub advance <project_path> [--force]
+  Returns: {previous_phase, current_phase, next_phase, validation, handoff_complete}
+  After: new phase context pack auto-built; resume with vibehub-continue.
+
+Pre-flight / 前置检查:
+  1. Run `vibehub validate <project>` to check all required outputs are present.
+  2. Run `vibehub handoff <project>` to check handoff is complete.
+  3. If handoff is incomplete, use --force only with user confirmation.
+
+Task / 任务:Advance to the next phase in the workflow. Requires all current phase outputs to be valid. If handoff is incomplete, advance is blocked unless --force is used.
